#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gparted"
msgstr "Instalação do Gparted"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Gparted</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Gparted</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:99
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "To run the tests, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para executar os testes, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-xhost-root</option>: This switch provides an interim "
"workaround to allow GParted to run under Wayland by using xhost to grant and"
" revoke root access to the X11 display."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-xhost-root</option>: Essa chave fornece uma solução "
"provisória para permitir que o GParted execute sob o Wayland usando xhost "
"para conceder e revogar acesso de root para a tela do X11."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid "Using Gparted"
msgstr "Usando o Gparted"

#. <xref linkend="reiserfs"/>
#. ,
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To manipulate file systems, Gparted has a run time dependency on various "
"file system tools (you only need to install the tools for file systems you "
"actually use): <xref linkend=\"hdparm\"/> (required for optionally "
"displaying the serial number of a device), <xref linkend=\"btrfs-progs\"/>, "
"<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dosfstools\"/>, e2fsprogs (installed as "
"part of LFS), <xref linkend=\"jfsutils\"/>, <xref linkend=\"ntfs-3g\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"xfsprogs\"/>, <ulink url=\"&gnu-"
"http;/mtools/\">mtools</ulink> (required to read and write FAT16/32 volume "
"labels and UUIDs), <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.mars.org/home/rob/proj/hfs/\">hfsutils</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://packages.debian.org/sid/hfsprogs\">hfsprogs</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://nilfs.sourceforge.io/en/\">nilfs-utils</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://reiser4.wiki.kernel.org/index.php/Reiser4progs\"> "
"Reiser4progs</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url='https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/jeffm/reiserfsprogs/'>"
" reiserfsprogs</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Para manipular sistemas de arquivos, Gparted tem uma dependência de tempo de"
" execução de várias ferramentas de sistema de arquivos (você só precisa "
"instalar as ferramentas para sistemas de arquivos que você realmente usar): "
"<xref linkend=\"hdparm\"/> (exigido para exibir opcionalmente o número de "
"série de um dispositivo), <xref linkend=\"btrfs-progs\"/>, <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"dosfstools\"/>, e2fsprogs (instalado como parte "
"do LFS), <xref linkend=\"jfsutils\"/>, <xref linkend=\"ntfs-3g\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"xfsprogs\"/>, <ulink url=\"&gnu-http;/mtools/\">mtools</ulink> "
"(exigido para ler e escrever rótulos de volume FAT16/32 e UUIDs), <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.mars.org/home/rob/proj/hfs/\">hfsutils</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://packages.debian.org/sid/hfsprogs\">hfsprogs</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://nilfs.sourceforge.io/en/\">nilfs-utils</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://reiser4.wiki.kernel.org/index.php/Reiser4progs\"> "
"Reiser4progs</ulink> e <ulink "
"url='https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/jeffm/reiserfsprogs/'>"
" reiserfsprogs</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Root privileges are required to run Gparted. If you want to run the "
"application from the menu, further applications and configuration might be "
"necessary depending on your desktop environment. If you are using KDE "
"Plasma, GNOME, or LXQt, your desktop includes an ssh-askpass implementation,"
" or a wrapper around Polkit that provides this functionality for you. If you"
" are not using one of these desktop environments, an easier solution is use "
"the generic <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/> package."
msgstr ""
"Privilégios de root são exigidos para executar o Gparted. Se você quiser "
"executar o aplicativo a partir do menu, outros aplicativos e configurações "
"podem ser necessários, dependendo do teu ambiente de área de trabalho. Se "
"você estiver usando KDE Plasma, GNOME ou LXQt, tua área de trabalho inclui "
"uma implementação do ssh-askpass ou um envolucrador em torno do Polkit que "
"fornece essa funcionalidade para você. Se você não estiver usando um desses "
"ambientes de área de trabalho, uma solução mais fácil é a de usar o pacote "
"genérico <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:178
#, xml-text
msgid "ssh-askpass"
msgstr "ssh-askpass"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To use <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/> if it is installed on your system, "
"run the following commands as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Para usar o <xref linkend=\"ssh-askpass\"/> se ele estiver instalado em teu "
"sistema, execute os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:184
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -v /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop.back &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i 's/Exec=/Exec=sudo -A /'               /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -v /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop.back &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i 's/Exec=/Exec=sudo -A /'               /usr/share/applications/gparted.desktop</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/gparted.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, when you click on the menu item for Gparted, a dialog will appear "
"asking for the administrator password."
msgstr ""
"Agora, quando você clicar no item de menu para o Gparted, uma caixa de "
"diálogo aparecerá solicitando a senha do(a) administrador(a)."

